   "xp": 753
  },
  {
   "copper": 64,
   "description": "Night brings Grave-Web Bonelurker Spiders to the Blackwind Hollowwood, which lies in the southeast of Blackwind Rise, and by morning our supply routes look ready for embalming. Kill six and return for payment. The bounty opens again twenty minutes after you collect; I shall keep a line in the accounts for unwanted shrouds.",
