  },
  {
   "copper": 128,
   "description": "The Gravewood Treant Hollowbell tolls in the Blackwind Hollowwood, east from here, as though the whole station were overdue for burial. Gather a group and kill it; even the dead should know better than to face that thing alone. I would like to hear the wind through the arches again.",
