   "turnin": "r20_anchor_040_host",
   "xp": 880
  },
  {
   "copper": 280,
   "description": "Mud has taken the names from their coats, but the Mire-Cured Husks still report for duty. Lay five to rest by day in the Causeway Toll Fields, which lie in the west of The Broken Causeway. Accord or Throng, a body deserves better than another shift in that mud.",
