  },
  {
   "copper": 280,
   "description": "The Fordwater Zombies still hold out their hands for a fare, though I doubt any remember the crossing. Destroy five after dark at the Causeway Last Ford, which lies in the west of The Broken Causeway. Keep your coins; I have tried paying, and the service is dreadful.",
