   "copper": 320,
   "description": "War Construct Last-Toll waits in the Causeway Toll Fields southeast from here; whoever built it neglected to include a closing hour. Take a group and destroy it, because it will make spare parts of a lone fighter. We have quite enough spare parts here already.",
